<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabo upgrades Endemol to Hold.</title>
<headline>Rabo upgrades Endemol to Hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (28/04)</p>
<p>Company-----Sector-----------Price-----Broker----------</p>
<p>Endemol     TV production    49.80     Rabo Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Upgraded to Hold after December downgrade to Sell. Endemol has underperformed media peers since December when Rabo said it was overvalued by some 25 pct. Overvaluation has now disappeared. Share price has been hit by bad news (Sport7, Holiday on Ice) but coming months should be quieter in this respect. Share price plunge seems to be over. Rabo's fundamental view of Endemol is unchanged: organic growth of core business is limited; expansion outside TV production brings greater risks.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):    EPS	P/E     P/CF    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996/97		 2.20     22.7    18.5    0.70</p>
<p>    1997/98		 2.40     20.8    17.0    0.80</p>
<p>    1998/99		 2.67     18.7    15.3    0.90</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
